    pk1:evidenceAgainst "2006-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony.py L146–L153: EXPECTED_SHA256 pins the specimen and scout manifest only; the reference JSON is hashed at run time but not pinned <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2006-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony.py#L146-L153>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-source-traceability-1>,
