    dct:source "Riedel-Kruse et al. (2007) Science 317:1911-1915 SOM & Morelli et al. (2009) HFSP J. 3:55-66 Eqs. 2-3 (collective period 22.18 min vs uncoupled 25.0 min)" ;
    rdfs:comment "DAPT Notch blockade (kappa=0) shifts period from 22.18 min to T_0 = 25.00 min (+12.7% slowing, Herrgen et al. 2010); continuous-DAPT lattice mean period 25.00 min" ;
