    rdfs:label "Morelli (2009) Kinematic Phase-Wave Law for an Advected FGF8/Wnt Frequency Profile" ;
    dct:description "Couples the delayed Kuramoto lattice to an advecting FGF8/Wnt frequency gradient so that posterior->anterior kinematic phase waves emerge, slow toward the determination front, and vanish for a uniform profile | Variables: omega(x): FGF8/Wnt-slaved autonomous frequency profile (rad/min); xi: distance from the tailbud (somite lengths); lambda_F: gradient decay length; v = S/T_seg: anterior cell flow speed; k(x): local phase wave number; N_w: number of kinematic waves across the PSM of length L" ;
    dct:source "Morelli et al. (2009) HFSP J. 3:55-66 (frequency profile & kinematic waves); Dubrulle et al. (2001) Cell 106:219-232 (FGF8 gradient); Soroldoni et al. (2014) Science 345:222-225 (wave kinematics)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2006-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony.py#L284-L319>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_023_delta_notch_phase_synchrony.lean#L119-L150> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def kinematic_phase_lag (Omega omega_eff dt : Int) : Int :=
  (Omega - omega_eff) * dt
theorem morelli_2009_kinematic_wave_phase_lag_law
    (Omega omega_1 omega_2 dt dt_1 dt_2 : Int) (h_omega : omega_1 ≤ omega_2) (h_dt : 0 ≤ dt) :
    kinematic_phase_lag Omega Omega dt = 0 ∧
    kinematic_phase_lag Omega omega_2 dt ≤ kinematic_phase_lag Omega omega_1 dt ∧
    kinematic_phase_lag Omega omega_1 dt_1 + kinematic_phase_lag Omega omega_1 dt_2 =
      kinematic_phase_lag Omega omega_1 (dt_1 + dt_2)"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "omega(xi) = omega_0 * exp(-xi/lambda_F);  k(x) = (Omega/v) * (1 - omega(x)/omega_0);  N_w = (1/S) * Int_0^L (1 - omega/omega_0) dx" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S1534-5807(02)00409-4>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cub.2010.06.034>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature04861>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1142538>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1253089>,
        <https://doi.org/10.2976/1.3027088> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Coupled Delayed Kuramoto Somite Field" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_023.kinematic_phase_lag" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_023.morelli_2009_kinematic_wave_phase_lag_law" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Itoh (2003) Mind bomb (Mib1) DeltaC Ubiquitination Coupling Gate" ;
    dct:description "Makes the Delta-Notch coupling strength a dynamical variable: mib null abolishes coupling like DAPT, hypomorphs reduce kappa_eff monotonically, and coupling restoration after Mib1 induction or DAPT washout proceeds with finite kinetics | Variables: u: Mib1-ubiquitinated signalling-competent DeltaC fraction; M: Mib1 E3-ligase activity (1 WT, 0 mib^ta52b); k_ub, k_endo: ubiquitination and endocytic turnover rates (min^-1); g: gamma-secretase (DAPT) cleavage gate; kappa_max: coupling at full ubiquitination" ;
    dct:source "Itoh et al. (2003) Dev Cell 4:67-82; Riedel-Kruse et al. (2007) Science 317:1911-1915 (DAPT washout, mib/aei/des/bea mutants)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2006-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony.py#L322-L354>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_023_delta_notch_phase_synchrony.lean#L152-L191> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def mib1_ubiquitinated_numerator (k_ub M : Nat) : Nat :=
  k_ub * M
def mib1_ubiquitinated_denominator (k_ub k_endo M : Nat) : Nat :=
  k_ub * M + k_endo
theorem itoh_2003_mib1_ubiquitination_gate_monotone
    (k_ub k_endo M_1 M_2 : Nat) (h : M_1 ≤ M_2) :
    mib1_ubiquitinated_numerator k_ub 0 = 0 ∧
    mib1_ubiquitinated_numerator k_ub M_1 ≤ mib1_ubiquitinated_denominator k_ub k_endo M_1 ∧
    mib1_ubiquitinated_numerator k_ub M_1 * mib1_ubiquitinated_denominator k_ub k_endo M_2 ≤
      mib1_ubiquitinated_numerator k_ub M_2 * mib1_ubiquitinated_denominator k_ub k_endo M_1"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "du/dt = k_ub*M*(1 - u) - k_endo*u;  u_ss = k_ub M/(k_ub M + k_endo);  kappa(t) = kappa_max*u(t)*g(t);  g = 1/(1 + (C_DAPT/IC50)^n)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S1534-5807(02)00409-4>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cub.2010.06.034>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature04861>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1142538>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1253089>,
        <https://doi.org/10.2976/1.3027088> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Coupled Delayed Kuramoto Somite Field" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_023.mib1_ubiquitinated_numerator" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_023.itoh_2003_mib1_ubiquitination_gate_monotone" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-6> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Riedel-Kruse (2007) Emergent Defect-Span Law (ALD/PRP from R_crit crossings)" ;
    dct:description "Replaces the hard-coded ALD = s_in + 5.5 / PRP = s_out + 5.5 of Pass 2 by an emergent read-out of the simulated coherence trajectory, whose defective span is independent of the maturation lag | Variables: s_cross: somite stage at which the determination-front lateral Kuramoto R first falls below R_crit; s_recross: stage at which it first recovers above R_crit after washout/restoration; Delta_n_det: determination-to-boundary maturation lag (2.5 somites)" ;
    dct:source "Riedel-Kruse et al. (2007) Science 317:1911-1915 Figs. 2-4 (R_crit threshold model of ALD and PRP)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2006-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony.py#L544-L557>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_023_delta_notch_phase_synchrony.lean#L193-L226> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def emergent_anterior_limit_of_defects (s_cross Delta_n_det : Nat) : Nat :=
  s_cross + Delta_n_det
def emergent_posterior_rescue_point (s_recross Delta_n_det : Nat) : Nat :=
  s_recross + Delta_n_det
theorem riedel_2007_emergent_defect_span_independent_of_determination_lag
    (s_cross s_recross Delta_n_det d : Nat) (h : s_cross ≤ s_recross) :
    emergent_posterior_rescue_point s_recross Delta_n_det -
      emergent_anterior_limit_of_defects s_cross Delta_n_det = s_recross - s_cross ∧
    s_cross ≤ emergent_anterior_limit_of_defects s_cross Delta_n_det ∧
    emergent_anterior_limit_of_defects s_cross (Delta_n_det + d) =
      emergent_anterior_limit_of_defects s_cross Delta_n_det + d ∧
    emergent_posterior_rescue_point s_recross (Delta_n_det + d) =
      emergent_posterior_rescue_point s_recross Delta_n_det + d"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "ALD = s_cross + Delta_n_det;  PRP = s_recross + Delta_n_det;  PRP - ALD = s_recross - s_cross" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S1534-5807(02)00409-4>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cub.2010.06.034>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature04861>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1142538>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1253089>,
        <https://doi.org/10.2976/1.3027088> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Coupled Delayed Kuramoto Somite Field" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_023.emergent_anterior_limit_of_defects" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_023.riedel_2007_emergent_defect_span_independent_of_determination_lag" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

